{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07891","headline":"宴崔明府宅夜观妓 · 孟浩然","name":"宴崔明府宅夜观妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画堂观妙妓，长夜正留宾。\n烛吐莲花艳，妆成桃李春。\n髻鬟低舞席，衫袖掩歌唇。\n汗湿偏宜粉，罗轻讵着身。\n调移筝柱促，欢会酒杯频。\n倘使曹王见，应嫌洛浦神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}